* C9 power-on reset, variant live, tran
* No .param vcc: the connect rules of net/por_ctrl_live.vams name the vdd net
* as the converters' supply, which binds live (plan D-C, P3.2a).
.hdl "../net/por_ctrl_live.vams" module=por_ctrl
.options connectrules=por_live
.include ../net/por.cir
.tran 10n 500u
.end
